# Elder Memories (otherAreas 24): the level edge and the setting, the option edges, the letter, the Prog arms past the
# table, the finishes outside their section and tradeComplete with no trade open. Level 17 at SUBJOB_QUEST_LEVEL 18: 119;
# at 17.4 (a GM setting; a decimal is read as Lua has it, so 17 >= 17.4 is false): 119; at 17: 111 (538), options 39
# and 41: nothing; at 16: 111, option 40: begun. Gilgamesh's Introductory Letter (a GM) at Prog 0: 117 (the letter is
# checked before the table), finished: completed, tradeComplete with nothing traded since the login (nothing taken), the
# subjob unlocked; the letter kept. Accepted again (a GM: available, then accepted), the letter taken (a GM): Prog -1 and
# Prog 3: Isacio nil (no default: nothing), the skull traded: nil. The letter (a GM) at Prog 3: 117, made available by
# a GM while it is open: no 117 handler: nothing. Accepted again at Prog 0, the letter taken: the skull: 115 (537);
# completed by a GM while it is open: no 115 handler: the skull kept, Prog stays 0. Accepted again (available, then
# accepted), the letter (a GM): 117, finished: completed; its tradeComplete takes the skull of the last trade (the
# 115 trade whose finish did nothing), which the trade container still holds.
lists Selbina/Isacio/onTrigger Selbina/Isacio/onTrade Selbina/onEventFinish/111 Selbina/onEventFinish/115 Selbina/onEventFinish/117
char zone=Selbina pos=-56.6,-0.9,-46.4 job=WAR lvl=17
item MagickedSkull
login
trigger Isacio                          # level 17 < 18: 119
finish
setting SUBJOB_QUEST_LEVEL 17.4         # a GM setting
trigger Isacio                          # 17 < 17.4: 119
finish
setting SUBJOB_QUEST_LEVEL 17           # a GM setting
trigger Isacio                          # 17 >= 17: 111 (538)
finish option=39                        # nothing
trigger Isacio                          # 111
finish option=41                        # nothing
setting SUBJOB_QUEST_LEVEL 16           # a GM setting
trigger Isacio                          # 17 >= 16: 111
finish option=40                        # begun
keyitem GilgameshsIntroductoryLetter    # a GM
trigger Isacio                          # the letter at Prog 0: 117 (not 114)
finish                                  # completed; tradeComplete: nothing traded, nothing taken; the subjob unlocked; the letter kept
quest OtherAreas.ElderMemories available # a GM
quest OtherAreas.ElderMemories accepted # a GM
delkeyitem GilgameshsIntroductoryLetter # a GM
charvar Quest[4][24]Prog -1             # a GM
trigger Isacio                          # Prog -1: no step: nil; no default: nothing
finish-if-event
trade Isacio MagickedSkull x1           # Prog -1: nil
charvar Quest[4][24]Prog 3              # a GM
trigger Isacio                          # Prog 3: nil; nothing
finish-if-event
trade Isacio MagickedSkull x1           # Prog 3: nil
keyitem GilgameshsIntroductoryLetter    # a GM
trigger Isacio                          # the letter at Prog 3: 117
quest OtherAreas.ElderMemories available # a GM, while 117 is open
finish                                  # no 117 handler while available: nothing
quest OtherAreas.ElderMemories accepted # a GM
delkeyitem GilgameshsIntroductoryLetter # a GM
charvar Quest[4][24]Prog 0              # a GM
trade Isacio MagickedSkull x1           # 115 (537)
quest OtherAreas.ElderMemories completed # a GM, while 115 is open
finish                                  # no 115 handler while completed: the skull kept, Prog stays 0
quest OtherAreas.ElderMemories available # a GM
quest OtherAreas.ElderMemories accepted # a GM
keyitem GilgameshsIntroductoryLetter    # a GM
trigger Isacio                          # the letter at Prog 0: 117
finish                                  # completed; tradeComplete takes the skull the 115 trade left in the trade container
